  (text "Battery: CR2032 in Keystone 3034 SMT holder (VDD 1.8-3.6 V, no regulator).\nMCU runs straight off the cell; the LED has its own reservoir (C4-C6)\nrefilled through R8, so LED pulses sag VLED, not VDD.\nReservoir must be ceramic: polymer/electrolytic leakage >> 0.4 uA standby.\nR7 sets LED peak current: (VLED - 1.35 V) / R7 ~ 110 mA at 3 V."
    (at 20.32 76.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0920ac47-fc34-4dd1-aac2-f8d343208e27")
  )
